              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Standard bearer has hand weapon, light armour and large shield. May ride a horse (+8) in which case exchanges large shield for shield. Army Standard Bearer. May alternatively have cataphract armour and ride a barded horse (+19) as a Cataphract.</characteristic>
